# DeepDose product shell

Product routes (`/grid`, `/dose`, `/bank`, `/profile`, `/account`, `/dosage`, `/connect`, `/chat`):

**North star:** Medmaxxing — max the med stack, get in Flow. Sleep score on Bank. Grid is the tribe feed.

Consumer tribe = **Dosers**. Movement = **Medmaxxing**. Token economy = **Get in Flow**. Company = **Deepdose**.

Consumer dose tags = **#Resetters / #Hijackers / #Crossers / #Batteries**.

## Bottom nav (3 tabs + post circle)

| Control | Route | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Home | `/grid` | Chronotype feed (Larks / Owls) + Flow |
| Friends | `/connect` | Discovery + Chat |
| Bank | `/bank` | Sleep score + today’s stack |
| **Post** (black circle, right of pill) | `/dose` | Stamp a cluster |

Profile / Me via top-right avatar (`/profile`). Alerts bell can still deep-link Bank.

## Visual / layout engine

**OpenAI-inspired fluid grid is the source of truth** (`deepdose-openai-grid.css`) — **sitewide**:

- One proportional column: `--oai-page-pad` + `--oai-page-max` (app) / `--oai-page-max-wide` (marketing)
- Auto-fit grids: `.dd-oai-auto-2|3|4` and 12-col `.dd-oai-grid`
- Product shell wraps content in `dd-oai-container` + `dd-oai-stack` via `ProductAppShell`
- Public + patient + clinical + enterprise use `DeepDoseShell variant="light"` (`seco-shell--light`)

**Light Flow shell everywhere** (splash, marketing, product). Tokens in `deepdose-product-space.css` — no raw hex in feature CSS. No dark ambient on public routes.

| Layer | Tokens |
|---|---|
| Layout | `--oai-page-pad`, `--oai-gap*`, `--oai-min-*` |
| Spacing | `--dd-inset`, `--dd-gap`, `--dd-stack` |
| Ink / surface | `--dd-ink*`, `--dd-surface*`, `--dd-border*` |
| Accent | `--dd-accent`, `--dd-cue-resetter|hijacker|crosser|battery` |

## Copy

- No waffle. Titles live in `AppTopBar` only.
- Dose cards: sleep score badge + **Flow** (not Sync/likes).
- Log: stamp photo only — no captions. Chemistry is Bank depth, not a Log gate.
- Consumer score = **sleep score**. Never lead with SRI in product chrome.
